      de: ["Construction initiated by the Radziwiłł family in 1586", "Built employing advanced Dutch bastion fortress designs", "Features an artificial lake, Širvėna, created for defense", "Destroyed by Swedish forces in 1704", "Reconstructed between 1978 and 1985", "Currently houses the Sėla Region Museum and an old brewery"],
