      de: ["The pivotal battle occurred between November 21 and 22, 1919", "Lithuanian forces defeated the West Russian Volunteer Army (Bermondtians)", "Secured a critical railway junction essential for national logistics", "Lithuanians captured a massive cache of weapons, artillery, and aircraft", "Permanently removed the Bermondt threat from Lithuanian territory", "The site features a prominent memorial park and a historic wooden windmill"],
